  dialogueText: {fileID: 1854255237399326699}
  sentences:
  - You there... traveler...
  - "I didn\u2019t think anyone would come this far. The others\u2014they\u2019ve
    vanished. Taken by the mist, or worse..."
  - 'I need you to defeat it. No one else can. '
  - "If it\u2019s not stopped now, we lose everything."
  - May the old spirits guide you. And may your courage outlast the darkness.
  typingSpeed: 0.1
